      "name": "Flurry of Strands",
      "sort": 700000,
      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The roper makes a strand Strike with each of its strands (except those that are @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilizing} creatures). Each attack must be against a different target. These attacks count toward the roper's multiple attack penalty, but its multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after all the attacks.</p>"
