      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "Pull the Strands",
      "sort": 800000,
      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The roper pulls every creature @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} by its strands toward itself. The roper rolls a single @Check[type:athletics] check and compares the result to each @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} creature's Fortitude DC. The roper pulls each creature it succeeds against up to 25 feet closer and each creature it critically succeeds against up to 50 feet closer.</p>"
        },
